## 七.数据流

### 7.1 出牌流程

```
[玩家点击手牌]
        │
        ▼
PlayPhaseManager.play_card(card_instance)
        │
        ▼
创建 PlayContext (context_id, card_instance, rhythm_context)
        │
        ▼
ChargeMediator.start_charging(context)
        │
        ├──► PlayContext.start_charging()
        │
        └──► RhythmAdapter.start_rhythm(required_charge, config)
                │
                ▼
        EventBus.fire("cards:request_rhythm_start", {...})
                │
                ▼
        RhythmAxisModule 开始运行...
                │
                ▼
        每次判定成功:
        EventBus.fire("rhythm:input_judged", {result, delta, ...})
                │
                ▼
        ChargeMediator._on_judged()
                │
                ├──► ChargeCalculator.calculate(result, delta, context)
                ├──► PlayContext.add_charge(amount)
                ├──► EventBus.fire("cards:charge_updated", {...})
                │
                └──► if is_completed:
                            │
                            ▼
                    ChargeMediator._on_charging_completed()
                            │
                            ├──► PlayContext.complete_charging()
                            ├──► RhythmAdapter.stop_rhythm()
                            ├──► EffectTrigger.trigger(card_instance)
                            └──► EventBus.fire("cards:card_charged", {...})

[效果触发]
EffectTrigger.trigger(card_instance)
        │
        ▼
CardEffect.execute(effect_id, card_instance)
        │
        ▼
EventBus.fire("cards:effect_triggered", {...})
        │
        ▼
PlayContext.cleanup()
        │
        ▼
DiscardPile.add_card(card_instance)
```

### 7.2 回合流程

```
[回合开始]
        │
        ▼
CardsModule.start_turn()
        │
        ├──► CardDeck.shuffle()
        ├──► HandArea.clear()
        └──► CardDealer.deal_cards(CARDS_DRAWN_PER_TURN)
                │
                ▼
        EventBus.fire("cards:turn_started", {...})
                │
                ▼
        [玩家出牌阶段 - 可循环]
                │
                ▼
[回合结束条件满足]
        │
        ▼
CardsModule.end_turn()
        │
        ├──► PlayPhaseManager.cleanup_all()
        ├──► DiscardPile.return_to_deck()
        └──► EventBus.fire("cards:turn_ended", {...})
```

